<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">当白日变得冰冷</text><text for="L2">当牌局尽数散场</text><text for="L3">我们眼中的圣人</text><text for="L4">竟皆金玉其表</text><text for="L5">当你的梦想尽数破灭</text><text for="L6">我们所颂扬之人</text><text for="L7">却最是卑劣</text><text for="L8">连热血也已凝滞</text><text for="L9">我多想掩藏真相</text><text for="L10">我多想庇护于你</text><text for="L11">可心中的野兽</text><text for="L12">令我们无处遁形</text><text for="L13">无论我们滋生何种恶</text><text for="L14">贪婪终是我们底色</text><text for="L15">我的王国已然降临</text><text for="L16">我的王国已然降临</text><text for="L17">当你感受到我的炽热</text><text for="L18">望入我的眼底</text><text for="L19">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L20">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L21">别靠得太近</text><text for="L22">内里暗无天日</text><text for="L23">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L24">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L25">帷幕落下</text><text for="L26">一切终将收场</text><text for="L27">当灯光黯淡熄灭</text><text for="L28">罪人们匍匐而出</text><text for="L29">他们已为你掘好坟墓</text><text for="L30">那场假面舞会</text><text for="L31">终将揭开真相</text><text for="L32">直面你酿成的乱局</text><text for="L33">我不愿让你失望</text><text for="L34">可我注定坠入地狱</text><text for="L35">尽管这一切皆为你</text><text for="L36">我不愿再掩藏真相</text><text for="L37">无论我们滋生何种恶</text><text for="L38">贪婪终是我们底色</text><text for="L39">我的王国已然降临</text><text for="L40">我的王国已然降临</text><text for="L41">当你感受到我的炽热</text><text for="L42">望入我的眼底</text><text for="L43">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L44">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L45">别靠得太近</text><text for="L46">内里暗无天日</text><text for="L47">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L48">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L49">他们说命由己造</text><text for="L50">我却道一切听天</text><text for="L51">早已织入我的灵魂</text><text for="L52">我须放你离去</text><text for="L53">你的眼眸如此明亮</text><text for="L54">我多想护住那道光</text><text for="L55">如今我无从逃脱</text><text for="L56">除非你为我指路</text><text for="L57">当你感受到我的炽热</text><text for="L58">望入我的眼底</text><text for="L59">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L60">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L61">别靠得太近</text><text for="L62">内里暗无天日</text><text for="L63">恶魔便藏匿于此</text><text for="L64">恶魔便藏匿于此</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Alexander Junior Grant</songwriter><songwriter>Benjamin Arthur Mckee</songwriter><songwriter>Daniel Coulter Reynolds</songwriter><songwriter>Daniel Wayne Sermon</songwriter><songwriter>Joshua Francis Mosser</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:57.507"><div begin="0.000" end="21.650" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0.000" end="2.829" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.000" end="0.470">When</span> <span begin="0.470" end="0.809">the</span> <span begin="0.809" end="1.755">days</span> <span begin="1.755" end="2.487">are</span> <span begin="2.487" end="2.829">cold</span></p><p begin="2.839" end="5.504" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2.839" end="3.184">And</span> <span begin="3.184" end="3.493">the</span> <span begin="3.493" end="4.511">cards</span> <span begin="4.511" end="5.112">all</span> <span begin="5.112" end="5.504">fold</span></p><p begin="5.525" end="8.192" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.525" end="5.810">And</span> <span begin="5.810" end="6.141">the</span> <span begin="6.141" end="7.177">saints</span> <span begin="7.177" end="7.726">we</span> <span begin="7.726" end="8.192">see</span></p><p begin="8.202" end="10.868" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.202" end="8.482">Are</span> <span begin="8.482" end="8.803">all</span> <span begin="8.803" end="9.505">made</span> <span begin="9.505" end="10.195">of</span> <span begin="10.195" end="10.868">gold</span></p><p begin="10.878" end="13.494" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.878" end="11.193">When</span> <span begin="11.193" end="11.473">your</span> <span begin="11.473" end="1